    <html:p>
    Hi there!
    Until recently, I worked as a software engineer.
    I'll be starting a PhD in mathematics in 2027, more <html:mark>updates soon</html:mark>!
    Read more <fr:link href="/about/" title="About me" uri="https://ruimp.com/about/" display-uri="about" type="local">about me here</fr:link>.
</html:p>
    <html:p>
    My research interests lie in the physical mathematics of quantum field theory.
</html:p>
    <html:p>Reach out at <fr:link href="mailto:rmp@ruimp.com" type="external">rmp@ruimp.com</fr:link>.</html:p>
