          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
    Hi, I'm Rui!
    My interests lie broadly in the physical mathematics of quantum field theory.
    I like to think about observables of conformal field theories and the mathematical structures that encode them, from both the unitary, and the homotopical and derived perspectives.
</html:p>
